## Korean Culture: The Houses of Koreans

You can see a variety of houses in Korea. The most common type of house is the apartment. The apartment is a building in a set location in which many people can live. In addition, it is convenient and safe to live in. For this reason, you can say that the apartment is the representative home of the city.

Other than that, many people live in villa apartments and detached houses. There are also some people who live in hanok, the traditional Korean-style houses.

