### 제2항 - Making a request at the office
**Lesson objective:** to understand the content of a request made to strangers or at public institutions.

#### Vocabulary
- 실례하다 - excuse me
- 저기 - excuse me
- 음 - um
- 어 - uh
- 자 - okay
- 아 - ah
- 저 - well
- 체크카드 - debit card
- 신분증 - identification card
- 글쎄요 - well, let me see
- 연장하다 - to extend or prolong
- 출입국관리사무소 - Immigration Office
- 서류 - document
- 재학증명서 - certificate of student registration
- 뵙다 - to meet (used when meeting people above you)
- 퇴근하다 - to leave one's office or get off from work
- 신청 - registration
- 지나가다 - to go past
- 음성안내기 - voice guide

#### Let's Listen

**1.**
