### I. Read the following and answer the questions.

**November 5 Tuesday, clear skies**

Something came up suddenly at my newspaper company so I have to go on a business trip to Japan starting tomorrow for four days. But I have a presentation at school in two days. So when my director told me about the business trip I made my request.

"Um, Director, I'm sorry, but will it be okay if someone else goes?"

My director did not grant my request.

"Yuki, I know it's difficult for you but you must be the one to go on this trip this time."

I'm not sure what I need to do at times like this. Should I change the date for the school presentation? If I turn in a document about my business trip to my teacher, will she change my presentation date? Will it be okay to change dates with a friend? Will I have to take Level 2 again if I can't do my presentation? It really is difficult having a job and studying at the same time.

