## Korean Culture: Popular Locations for Meeting Appointments

Where are the popular places for making an appointment to meet people in Seoul? The five most popular places searched on the internet to make appointments to meet people are Hongdae, Gangnam station, Apgujeong, Garosugil, and Itaewon.

Among these places, Hongdae is number one and many young people go there because of the good restaurants, cafes with a nice atmosphere, stylish clothes stores, fun clubs and bars, and various street performances like busking.

You get a more elegant atmosphere in places like Gangnam station, Apgujeong, and Garosugil. Itaewon is the place you can experience the various cultures of different countries.